  "content": "![](https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1348169/description_2c9048b4-f192-455b-acb1-29e66f0d6c8c.png)\n\n***\n\n# 再次體驗 C418 獨特 Minecraft 音樂的懷舊感！\n\n_你是否曾想過，如果 Mojang 繼續與 C418 合作，會是什麼樣子？他會如何在其**標誌性且懷舊的配樂**上更進一步？自從 Mojang 與 C418 分道揚鑣後，社群和我們自己一直在想：**原本可能如何？**_\n\n_但我們並不僅止於想像，因此這個模組為遊戲帶來了 **22 首自製配樂** **和唱片歌曲**！_\n\n***\n\n這個模組共有 **22 首曲目**，是超過一年心血的結晶。它不是隨便從 YouTube 挑選一些有點像素風格的免版稅歌曲，而是**仔細研究**了原版 C418 配樂，旨在為 Minecraft 開發新音樂的同時，**忠於其根源**。\n\n這些曲目無縫融入這些**永恆經典**之中，重新捕捉了 C418 作品《Volume Alpha》、《Volume Beta》和《Aquatic Update》的**懷舊質感**。\n\n憑藉 **15 首遊戲內曲目**和 7 張完全**從零創作**的唱片，為你的世界增添了全新的聽覺體驗，希望在那些完美的微小瞬間響起時，能再次帶給你永恆的回憶。\n\n***\n\n## 歌曲列表\n\n<details>\n<summary>點擊展開歌曲列表</summary>\n  \n| 遊戲內配樂| 唱片|\n|:--------------------|:----------------------|\n| 1. Guenzburg| 16. Wuop|\n| 2. Two Note Dance| 17. Loofah|\n| 3. Lock| 18. Fly|\n| 4. Gom| 19. Kena|\n| 5. Waterfall Novella| 20. Bloupy|\n| 6. Flotsam| 21. Melanc|\n| 7. Scrat| 22. Harvest|\n| 8. Wind| |\n| 9. Axiom| |\n| 10. Main Menu| |\n| 11. Nokk| |\n| 12. Red Fortress| |\n| 13. Ni| |\n| 14. Bumpy| |\n| 15. Farvel Memory| |\n\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>點擊展開歌曲影片</summary>\n  \n[在此處尋找 YouTube 播放清單](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qha_hrEaUCs&list=PLjmrGYLfi3Cblm0IKhg2TWj53rYiO_Yv7)\n\n或在 Modrinth 上觀看：\n<details>\n<summary>遊戲內</summary>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/FG1XL9hNSrs\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/KhoGGC65bkE\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/KsE5TLdyNqs\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/PKpAhsKOYdE\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/SssBoAnCuFk\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/zO2fDFeOsF0\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/9SuThaItnrg\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/XOyzUa9nLhY\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/_U0RcLj3gC8\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/6mvKIMazcDI\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/RvTGnoVo8ek\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/0gR_LA0lqmU\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/fsod-bQ5r6o\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/58X9ad-sS0s\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/jWbI5sjIzgY\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>唱片</summary>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/7CTlFf5s2Is\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/ELqeJP71U-E\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/msc_-y67Mns\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/n5rbmNrGqWY\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/bbfaKePmNow\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/OMc6s6Fl6z0\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/qha_hrEaUCs\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n</details>\n\n</details>\n\n***\n\n## 特色\n\n*   應與模組生物群系完全相容，並正常播放（請確保在 beta 版本中回報相關問題...）\n*   22 首新歌曲\n    *   15 首遊戲世界曲目\n    *   7 張唱片（可透過自訂事件、戰利品箱/村民交易獲得）\n\n***\n\n## 版本支援\n\n根據不同啟動器和 Minecraft 版本，提供以下功能：\n\n| 版本                                          \t| Fabric Full \t| Fabric Lite \t| Forge Lite  \t|\n|--------------------------------------------------\t|-------------\t|-------------\t|-------------\t|\n| 1.21.11                                          \t| ✅        \t|             \t| 即將推出 \t|\n| 1.21.10                                          \t| ✅           \t|             \t|             \t|\n| 1.21<br>1.21.1                                   \t|             \t| ✅           \t|             \t|\n| 1.20,<br>1.20.1,<br>1.20.2,<br>1.20.3,<br>1.20.4 \t|             \t| ✅           \t|             \t|\n\n|                                                                                 \t| Full   \t| Lite \t|\n|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------\t|--------\t|------\t|\n| 背景音樂                                                                        \t| ✅      \t| ✅    \t|\n| 唱片                                                                           \t| ✅      \t| ✅    \t|\n| 更好的音樂選擇演算法<br>(情境音樂、村莊、白天等) \t| ✅      \t|      \t|\n| 可自訂播放清單<br>(停用特定歌曲/藝術家)                                       \t| ⌛ 近期 \t|      \t|\n| 模組生物群系播放 Volume Gamma 歌曲                                           \t| ✅      \t| 🤷🏻   \t|\n| 音樂瀏覽器與檢視器                                                        \t| ⌛ 近期 \t|      \t|\n\n***\n\n## 未來計畫\n\n該模組配備了一個（尚未完全完成的）系統，可根據生物群系類型（生物群系標籤）、特定生物群系、白天時間以及在村莊、洞穴或水下等特定情況來分配歌曲。在該系統完全完成後，此模組將能夠作為一種庫，讓使用者更輕鬆、更精確地將自訂歌曲分配到這些類別中。作為副效果，模組生物群系也能根據其分配參數播放特定的原版歌曲（不僅是遊戲播放清單）和模組歌曲。\n\n計劃推出一個音樂瀏覽器，將具備以下功能：\n\n*   啟用/停用任何你喜歡的歌曲\n*   將歌曲從創造模式添加到生存模式\n*   預設設定（例如關閉「現代」配樂）\n*   自訂你自己的預設\n\n此外，請注意這是首次發布，我們將盡力修復可能出現的任何錯誤。但這需要你的合作，請在我們的[專用回報追蹤器](https://github.com/crontent/volume-gamma/issues)中回報所有崩潰、問題和其他狀況。",
